[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-IRS002
TITLE: Link events for delivery and faults
STATEMENT: >>>
The link shall report delivered when a transmission reaches the peer, blocked when an outbound transmission does not, garbled when an inbound transmission cannot be used, and down and up when the link changes state. A garble shall say whether it was addressed to this aircraft. Acceptance is a blocked send that is absent from the peer queue and an addressed garble that produces Say again.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The events are how the aircraft learns the port state without a radio model.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Interface
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
